iv class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmBlocked_eq\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64</span>.<span class=\"name\">PMat</span>.<span class=\"name\">gemmBlocked_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmBlocked\">gemmBlocked</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">B</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <span class=\"fn\">C</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Level3.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmModel\">gemmModel</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">B</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> <span class=\"fn\">C</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`gemmBlocked` computes `gemm`, with the same result to the bit.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmBlocked_eq","kind":"theorem","line":926,"name":"BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmBlocked_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.lean#L926-L967"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmBlocked\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64</span>.<span class=\"name\">PMat</span>.<span class=\"name\">gemmBlocked</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`gemmBlocked α A B β C` is `gemm α A B β C`, by blocked loops that are about twice as fast. It\nscales `C` by `β`, then, for each block of 128 terms `l` and each block of 256 rows of `C`, it\nsweeps the rows of the block for two columns of `C` and four terms at a time: each sweep reads four\ncolumns of `A` and updates two columns of `C`, and the C compiler vectorizes it. The last column,\nwhen `n` is odd, and the terms that don't make a group of four go one at a time. Each element of\n`C` gets the same terms in the same order as in `gemm`, so the result is the same, which\n`gemmBlocked_eq` proves.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmBlocked","kind":"def","line":373,"name":"BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmBlocked","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.lean#L373-L404"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmTermBlocks\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64</span>.<span class=\"name\">PMat</span>.<span class=\"name\">gemmTermBlocks</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.html#BLAS.Float64.gemmFits\">gemmFits</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">l₀</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">_hl₀</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">l₀</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">ScalarArray.Float64Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hc</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">c</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Subtype\">{</a> <span class=\"fn\">c'</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Subtype\">:</a> <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">ScalarArray.Float64Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Subtype\">//</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">c'</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Subtype\">}</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Adds the terms `l₀ ≤ l < k` to `C`, by `gemmRowBlocks` on blocks of 128 terms.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmTermBlocks","kind":"def","line":343,"name":"BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmTermBlocks","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.lean#L343-L371"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float64/GemmBlocked.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat.gemmRowBlocks\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64</span>.<span class=\"name\">PMat</span>.<span class=\"name\">gemmRowBlocks</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/PMat.html#BLAS.Float64.PMat\">PMat</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=